    "chunk_text": "ode o\u00f0f\u00e6ste. Sume d\u00e6ge, \u00fea mid \u00fey \u00fee heo geheold hyre fostormodor sc\u00e6p mid o\u00ferum f\u00e6mnum, hire \u00dea geseh he \u00fea eadegan Margaretan be \u00feam wege sittan & hr\u00e6ddlice he hire \u00fea gyrnde & cw\u00e6\u00fe to his \u00dea cempan \u00fea eodan & hie genoman. Se eadega Margareta \u00fea ongan Criste clypian & \u00feus cw\u00e6\u00fe: Gemildsa me, dryhten, & ne l\u00e6t \u00feu mine Ic beo nu, drihten, swa swa nytenu onmiddan felde & swa swa sp\u00e6rwe on n\u00ebtte & swa swa fisc on Gefylst my me, min drihten, & geheald me & ne forl\u00e6t me on arleasra manna handa. \u00d0a cempan \u00fea coman to \u00feam gerefan & cw\u00e6don, hlaford, ne miht \u00feu hire onfon, for\u00feon to gode heo hig Olibrius, se gerefa, hire gehet to him gel\u00e6don & hire to cw\u00e6\u00fe, of hwylcum cynne eart \u00feu, s\u00e6g\u00e6 me, Se eadega Margareta him to cw\u00e6\u00fe, ic eom frig. Se gerefa hire to cw\u00e6\u00fe, hwylces geleafan eart \u00feu, o\u00fe\u00fee ic eom geciged. Se gerefa hire to cw\u00e6\u00fe, hwylcne god beg\u00e6st \u00feu? Se halga Margareta him to cw\u00e6\u00fe, ic gebidde me on ealmihtigne god & on his sunu, h\u00e6lend Crist, se \u00fee Se gerefa hire to cw\u00e6\u00fe, clypest \u00feu on \u00feone Crist \u00fee mine, f\u00e6deras ahengon? Se halga Margareta hine to cw\u00e6\u00fe, \u00feine f\u00e6deras Crist ahengon & \u00fey hi ealle forwurdon. Ac",
